(p (i Grammar.) For those interested in the mechanics of the language. (i This is a work-in-progress.))
(p (i Study.) The (ref @url "https://app.adhyeta.org.in/x/" study mode) gamifies your Sanskrit journey by providing stats on your vocabulary acquisition progress. It lets you mark the words you know and add notes/meaning to words you don't.)
